Read the file spending.csv, which has our household spending.
Let our budget for groceries be $400, for eating out $150, for transport $120 and for fun $100.
Total the amount per month.
Say how much we spent in each category for each month.
If a category went over its budget in a month, say which one it was and by how much.
Make a bar chart of the total we spent each month called months.svg.
